### REVIEW SERVICE  ·  http://localhost:3000/reviews
###
### review-service has no dependency on book-service in either direction: a
### bookId is taken on trust. One review per (book, user), enforced by a unique
### index — so a repeated submit conflicts instead of duplicating, which is why
### there is no Idempotency-Key here.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = amr@example.com
@password = password123


### Log in
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}


### A book to review
# @name createBook
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "title": "The Seam", "description": "A book that exists, so we can review it.", "genre": ["non-fiction"] }

@bookId = {{createBook.response.body.data.id}}


### ── WRITES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create  →  201
# @name createReview
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": "{{bookId}}", "rating": 5, "comment": "Held up under partition." }

@reviewId = {{createReview.response.body.data.id}}


### Same user, same book, again  →  409
### The unique index is what makes the retry safe.
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": "{{bookId}}", "rating": 3, "comment": "Second opinion." }


### Update — author only  →  200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 4 }


### ── READS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### A book's reviews  →  200.  bookId is required.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews?bookId={{bookId}}


### One review  →  200
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}


### ── CLEANUP ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Delete — author only  →  204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
